        {
          "docs": "The light-client layout the store starts in, which is the bootstrap's (`LcFork` as\n0 = Altair … 4 = Gloas). The store moves to a later layout when the chain reaches a later\nfork of `fork_epochs` (`ferrata_core::steps::store_for_update`); its current layout is in\nits encoding (`InstanceState::store`).",
          "name": "store_fork",
